  "changelog": "Initial release \u2014 Complete overhaul to create an all-scenario lawyer assistant for civil and criminal law.\n\n- Major refactor: replaces old codebase and documentation with a new structure supporting comprehensive legal workflows covering legal search, case search, evidence OCR/analysis, document drafting, non-litigation, enforcement, and labor disputes.\n- Implements a strict anti-fabrication protocol: all legal citations and case references require online source verification; model memory citations are strictly prohibited.\n- Adds detailed workflow decision trees, modular practical references for different legal tasks, and structured output templates.\n- Integrates evidence OCR processing via script or external skill.\n- Simplifies usage by automatically routing user queries through the appropriate legal workflow based on the scenario.\n- Removes legacy scripts, test data, and documentation from previous versions.",
